## 2. Acceptance boundary

Owner rule keeps post-freeze findings outside the eight-item merge gate in Phase 5; do not alter v1 or add required Phase 4 tests (`docs/phase4/PHASE_4_ACCEPTANCE_CRITERIA.md:60-72`).

